resize_on_border for pen and touch. A pen tip or a finger landing on a window's border
grab zone starts the same MBIND_RESIZE drag a mouse press there would (one
keystone-aware test, CInputManager::isOnResizeBorder, shared by all three); the press
never reaches the client, the pen drives the drag through its cursor and the finger
